{
  "slug": "product-in-acquisitions",
  "name": "Product In Acquisitions",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "An operating system for product leaders running post-acquisition integrations. Walks acquiring-company product leaders through the 90-day framework: Week 0 readiness, roadmap convergence, market positioning stability, and people integration. Each skill produces four to six named deliverables, each backed by a reference template.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `people-integration` (Design the first 90 days for acquired product talent so they stay, contribute, and feel ownership), `positioning-stability` (Build the post-acquisition positioning, sales enablement, and customer outreach kit), `roadmap-convergence` (Facilitate the post-acquisition roadmap convergence process across Weeks 1 to 8), `week-0-readiness` (Run a product leader through pre-close (Week 0) integration readiness for an acquisition)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install product-in-acquisitions@claude-community` from `enalbenerraw/blanewarrene` (`plugins/product-in-acquisitions-os`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
